msgid "A few details"
msgstr "Sedikit data tentangmu"

msgid "About the data"
msgstr "Tentang data"

msgid "Agree and continue"
msgstr "Setuju dan lanjut"

msgid "Anonymous totals may appear in Arthur's public portfolio."
msgstr "Angka total tanpa nama boleh muncul di portofolio publik Arthur."

