msgid "Enter the invite code Arthur gave you."
msgstr "Masukkan kode undangan dari Arthur."

msgid "Everything about you is gone from Juku. Encrypted backups are kept for 7 days, so the last copies disappear within 7 days."
msgstr "Semua datamu sudah dihapus dari Juku. Cadangan terenkripsi disimpan selama 7 hari, jadi salinan terakhir hilang dalam 7 hari."

