msgstr "Beranda"

msgid "I agree to use the service as described above, including progress tracking, weekly reports and Shiori remembering how I learn."
msgstr "Saya setuju memakai layanan seperti dijelaskan di atas, termasuk pencatatan kemajuan, laporan mingguan, dan Shiori yang mengingat cara saya belajar."

